# Predefined environment variable palette, copied into the image as
# /home/trustable/.env.default and folded into `predefined_env` at startup by
# importDefaultPredefinedEnv (configure.go).
#
# This is NOT server configuration — that is `env` in this directory, which
# becomes .env. Nothing here is ever applied to an application on its own; the
# values only pre-fill the palette shown on the Configure page, and reach an app
# only via "Use predefined values" followed by an explicit save.
#
# The import is keep-existing: names already present in the workspace config are
# never overwritten, so editing a value on the Configure page survives a restart.
# AI_API_KEY is intentionally blank: this file is committed, and an empty value
# is a supported state — it records the name as predefined without offering a
# secret, and an empty value never satisfies a required key. Fill it in on the
# Configure page; the keep-existing import will not overwrite it afterwards.
AI_BASE_URL=https://ollama.com/v1
AI_API_KEY=
AI_CHAT_MODEL=glm-5.2:cloud
